OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOne or two
OL,6,Fisolated showers possible at first,
OL,7,Fotherwise a fine evening leading into
OL,8,Fa very mild night. Becoming cloudier
OL,9,Ffrom the west during the early hours,
OL,10,Falthough likely staying dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FMild and humid to start, as a
OL,13,Fweakening band of rain moves
OL,14,Fsoutheast. Becoming drier, brighter
OL,15,Fand fresher later, with a breeze and
OL,16,Fsome warm sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
